---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Work with Sue | Knit it Now"
  description="Personal machine knitting support with Sue: quick help or project support."
>
  <section class="container py-5 work-with-sue-page">
    <div class="work-with-sue-inner">
      <div class="work-with-sue-hero">
        <div class="hero-text">
          <h1>Work with Sue</h1>
          <p class="work-with-sue-intro">
            With over 20 years of machine knitting experience, I help knitters get unstuck, solve
            problems, and move forward with confidence.
          </p>
          <p class="work-with-sue-intro-secondary">
            Whether you're troubleshooting your machine or trying to finish a project, we'll figure
            out the next best step together.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="hero-image">
          <div class="quick-help-image-card">
            <img
              src="/images/knit-by-machine-sue.png"
              alt="Sue helping with a knitting machine"
              loading="eager"
              decoding="async"
            />
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="work-with-sue-grid">
        <div class="kbm-card work-with-sue-card work-card">
          <img src="/images/help.svg" alt="" class="card-icon" width="60" height="60" />
          <h2>Quick Help Session</h2>
          <p>
            Stuck on something right now? This 15-minute session is for a specific machine knitting
            question, problem, or next step.
          </p>
          <ul>
            <li>Get unstuck fast</li>
            <li>Ask your question</li>
            <li>Leave with a clear next step</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="card-button">
            <a href="/help-hub/quick-help" class="kbm-button">Book a 15-Minute Call</a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="kbm-card work-with-sue-card work-card">
          <img src="/images/help.svg" alt="" class="card-icon" width="60" height="60" />
          <h2>Project Support Sprint</h2>
          <p>
            Need more than a quick answer? This option is for knitters who want ongoing support
            while working through a project, solving a bigger issue, or building confidence over
            time.
          </p>
          <ul>
            <li>Support while you work through your project</li>
            <li>Help with fit, shaping, or technique</li>
            <li>Stay on track and keep moving forward</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="card-button">
            <a href="/help-hub/guided-workshop" class="kbm-button kbm-button-outline">
              Learn About the 3-Week Sprint
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="work-with-sue-closing">
        Not sure which option is the best fit? Start with the one that feels closest to the help
        you need right now.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <style>
    .work-with-sue-inner {
      max-width: 960px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .work-with-sue-hero {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 2rem;
      margin-bottom: 2.25rem;
    }

    .hero-text {
      flex: 1;
      min-width: 0;
    }

    .hero-text h1 {
      font-size: var(--text-xxl);
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--kbm-green);
      margin: 0 0 0.85rem 0;
    }

    .hero-image {
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .hero-image .quick-help-image-card {
      max-width: min(316px, 100%);
    }

    .hero-image img {
      max-width: 300px;
      width: 100%;
      height: auto;
    }

    .quick-help-image-card {
      background: #ffffff;
      padding: 8px;
      border-radius: 14px;
      box-shadow: 0 20px 45px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.18);
    }

    .quick-help-image-card img {
      width: 100%;
      display: block;
      border-radius: 10px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 767px) {
      .work-with-sue-hero {
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: stretch;
        gap: 1.25rem;
      }

      .hero-image {
        align-self: center;
      }

      .hero-image .quick-help-image-card {
        max-width: min(300px, 100%);
      }
    }

    .card-icon {
      width: 60px;
      height: 60px;
      display: block;
      margin: 0 auto 0.4rem auto;
    }

    .card-button {
      text-align: center;
      margin-top: auto;
      padding-top: 1rem;
    }

    .work-with-sue-intro,
    .work-with-sue-intro-secondary {
      color: #243015;
      line-height: 1.6;
      margin: 0;
      max-width: 44rem;
    }

    .work-with-sue-intro {
      font-size: var(--text-lg);
      margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
    }

    .work-with-sue-intro-secondary {
      font-size: var(--text-base);
    }

    .work-with-sue-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 1.5rem;
      margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
    }

    @media (min-width: 768px) {
      .work-with-sue-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      }
    }

    .work-with-sue-card {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.85rem;
      margin: 0;
    }

    .work-with-sue-card h2 {
      font-size: var(--text-xl);
      color: var(--kbm-green);
      margin: 0.25rem 0 0 0;
    }

    .work-with-sue-card p {
      margin: 0;
      color: #243015;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .work-with-sue-card ul {
      margin: 0;
      padding-left: 1.2rem;
      color: #243015;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .work-with-sue-page .kbm-button {
      background-color: #c96a4a;
      color: #fff;
      padding: 10px 18px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      text-decoration: none;
      display: inline-flex;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .work-with-sue-page .kbm-button:hover {
      background-color: #b85c3e;
    }

    .work-with-sue-page .kbm-button.kbm-button-outline {
      background-color: transparent;
      color: var(--kbm-green, #52682d);
      border: 2px solid var(--kbm-green, #52682d);
    }

    .work-with-sue-page .kbm-button.kbm-button-outline:hover {
      background-color: rgba(82, 104, 45, 0.08);
    }

    .work-with-sue-card .card-button .kbm-button {
      display: inline-flex;
    }

    .work-with-sue-closing {
      margin: 0;
      max-width: 44rem;
      color: #243015;
      line-height: 1.6;
      font-size: var(--text-base);
    }
  </style>
</Layout>
